{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1217","id":3982893156,"node_id":"PR_kwDOO5D6p87tZiBk","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1217","diff_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1217.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pull/1217.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1217","number":1217,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[codex] Wire full beta posture into Copilot wording","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Summary\n\n- Normalize full-beta question posture rows into the Paper Workspace Copilot context packet.\n- Gate student-visible Copilot wording by evidence availability, method diagnostic posture, FigureAsset posture, visual-dependent diagnosis posture, and rights/display posture.\n- Add real posture-map row coverage for text-only unavailable wording and visual-required suppression, with synthetic fixtures only for posture statuses not present in the current checked-in map.\n- Add a runtime readback artifact documenting covered paths, real vs synthetic fixtures, and explicit no-claim boundaries.\n\n## Why\n\nThe runtime already had the full 3530-row posture map and registry, but the visible Copilot ask/result path still needed proof that it consumes real posture-map rows before assembling student-facing copy. Without that, low-confidence or unavailable evidence could accidentally produce official-sounding method diagnosis, and visual-required rows could leak visual-dependent diagnosis before FigureAsset, receipt, and rights gates pass.\n\n## Validation\n\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` — pass with warning only for no upstream tracking ref; worktree clean.\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --runInBand --runTestsByPath src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/copilot-evidence-wording-gate.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-posture-source-adapter.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-question-universe-registry.test.js src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/full-beta-text-first-attempt-flow.test.js` — pass, 4 suites / 19 tests.\n- `node --experimental-vm-modules node_modules/jest/bin/jest.js --no-cache --runInBand --runTestsByPath src/pages/paper-workspace/__tests__/paper-workspace-pr4a-v1-adapter.test.js` — pass, 1 suite / 22 tests. `--no-cache` avoids a stale Jest haste-map path; the run still reports an existing `.worktrees/codex-landing-experiment/package.json` naming warning.\n- `git diff --check` — pass.\n\n## No-claim boundaries\n\nNo VLM run, Supabase mutation, rights approval, visual acceptance, launch readiness, official scoring readiness, or student-display-final claim is made.","created_at":"2026-07-03T02:50:18Z","updated_at":"2026-07-03T02:53:03Z","closed_at":"2026-07-03T02:52:00Z","merged_at":"2026-07-03T02:52:00Z","merge_commit_sha":"82b615a1cd8beb620adbc85a41d3a57b2496c3e0","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_